        "en": {
          "headline": "Kherson ceasefire ends after six days as evacuations conclude",
          "body": "The localised truce in the Kherson region ended on Sunday evening after neither side announced an extension, the South China Morning Post reported. Outlets including the BBC, Le Monde and Der Spiegel described it as the longest local pause in fighting since Russia's full-scale invasion in 2022. Al Jazeera reported no violations in the Kherson region during the six-day ceasefire, while Moscow and Kyiv continued strikes elsewhere."
        }
