          "headline": "Ukraine says it evacuated 167 people from southern Kherson region",
          "body": "Ukraine's military said it evacuated 167 people from threatened areas of the southern Kherson region on Sunday, according to The Straits Times. Der Spiegel reported that nearly 200 civilians were brought to safety shortly before the local truce expired. France 24 reported that residents of Oleshky who had requested evacuation were reunited with relatives in Ukraine on Saturday, 31 October."
